Package: frostpane
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Frostpane contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/duruer/frostpane
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libssl3 | libssl3t64
Recommends: libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, fonts-noto-cjk
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Snow, rain and other weather on your desktop
 Frostpane draws falling snow, rain, cherry blossom, autumn leaves,
 fireflies and shooting stars over your desktop. Snow settles on your
 windows, and you can roll snowballs and build snowmen. Clicks pass straight
 through. Runs from the system tray.
 .
 Full support on X11; Wayland on KDE, sway and Hyprland (layer-shell).
